OL,3,GNEWSAAdventurer who lost leg says
OL,4,A'don't send me money'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn adventurer who lost a leg in a
OL,7,Fmotorbike crash has warned people not
OL,8,Fto send money in response to social
OL,9,Fmedia messages from someone pretending
OL,10,Fto be him.
OL,12,FLuke Tarrant, 30, from Bedford, who has
OL,13,Fmore than 770,000 followers on TikTok
OL,14,Fand Instagram, said he was "disgusted"
OL,15,Fand extremely angry after discovering
OL,16,Fsomeone had been scammed into
OL,17,Ftransferring their life savings to a
OL,18,Ffake Facebook page.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
