OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAdventurer who lost leg says
OL,4,A'don't send me money'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the page had been created in
OL,7,Fhis name with private messages asking
OL,8,Fif people had "anything you can spare"
OL,9,Fas "things have been a bit difficult
OL,10,Flately".
OL,12,FTarrant said he reported it to Meta,
OL,13,Fwhich owns the site. The company
OL,14,Fconfirmed the page had been removed
OL,15,F"for violating our policies".
